{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "右", "id": "右"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "好", "id": "好"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "師", "id": "師"}, {"form": "朝", "id": "朝"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "當", "id": "當"}, {"form": "罪", "id": "罪"}, {"form": "聽", "id": "聽"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "責", "id": "責"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.044522437723423, "source": "死", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.456735772821304, "source": "死", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 3.044522437723423, "source": "死", "target": "當"}, {"weight": 2.456735772821304, "source": "罪", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 3.5553480614894135, "source": "師", "target": "右"}, {"weight": 2.4383866341531073, "source": "師", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.8213788864092133, "source": "當", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 2.2335922215070942, "source": "當", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.05127066471314, "source": "子", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 2.302585092994046, "source": "子", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 3.1498829533812494, "source": "子", "target": "責"}, {"weight": 0.5108256237659907, "source": "大", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 3.1498829533812494, "source": "大", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 0.7519876805828787, "source": "大", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.2335922215070942, "source": "大", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 1.2039728043259361, "source": "大", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 2.05127066471314, "source": "大", "target": "責"}, {"weight": 0.7621400520468967, "source": "人", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 1.6094379124341003, "source": "人", "target